 "_readme": [
  "GWP-100 values as PUBLISHED by each IPCC assessment report. These are closed",
  "reports: the numbers do not change, which is exactly what lets a check built",
  "on them stay valid without maintenance.",
  "",
  "ADDING A REPORT (e.g. AR7): append its short name to `bases` in published",
  "order and add its values under each gas. No code change is required \u2014 the",
  "field patterns, the table-header matcher and the comparison order are all",
  "ALIASES: alternate spellings live in `aliases`, also data. A gas the tool",
  "cannot name is a gas it silently ignores, so add spellings you see in the wild.",
  "derived from `bases` at import time.",
  "",
  "REGENERATE the values:",
  "  curl -s 'https://api.greencalculus.com/v1/factors?key_prefix=gwp&limit=100' \\",
  "    | python3 -c \"import json,sys,re;d=json.load(sys.stdin);\\",
  "      [print(r['key'], r['factor']['value']) for r in d['factors']]\"",
  "  (no API key needed; page with the meta.next_cursor value)"
 ],
